This code creates a keystroke-logging application that records all keyboard inputs. It uses a keyboard hook to monitor keystrokes, stores them in a file, and runs at startup. Ensure to use this responsibly and with proper authorization to respect user privacy.<｜end▁of▁sentence｜>

