When the program ends, uninstall the hook:
```c++
void Uninstall() {
    if (callbackKeyboard) {
        callbackKeyboard = UnhookKeyboard(callbackKeyboard);
        cout << "Uninstalled keyboard hook." << endl;
    }
}
```

