This code installs a low-level keyboard hook that logs each key press, including modifier keys. It converts the key presses to their corresponding characters and logs them to the console. The hook runs continuously, capturing all input until it's removed. Ensure to run this with administrative privileges and use it ethically.<｜end▁of▁sentence｜>

